 omgithub:readme:start -->\n## 🚀 Build, play, and remix with OMGithub\n\n**Created using [OMGithub.com](https://go.ondev.store/).**\n\n[![OMGithub](https://img.shields.io/badge/OMGithub-Open%20project-orange?style=for-the-badge)](https://go.ondev.store/mrjeanmrjean29-debug/PlayGround)\n[![GitHub](https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Source-181717?logo=github&style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/mrjeanmrjean29-debug/PlayGround)\n\n- 🎮 [Open the project](https://go.ondev.store/mrjeanmrjean29-debug/PlayGround).\n- ✨ [Remix this project](https://go.ondev.store/mrjeanmrjean29-debug/PlayGround?remix=1).\n- 💻 [Explore the source](https://github.com/mrjeanmrjean29-debug/PlayGround).\n- 🛠️ [Check build runs](https://github.com/mrjeanmrjean29-debug/PlayGround/actions).\n- 🐛 [Report an issue](https://github.com/mrjeanmrjean29-debug/PlayGround/issues).\n- 👤 [Explore the creator's projects](https://go.ondev.store/mrjeanmrjean29-debug).\n- 🌍 [Create with OMGithub](https://go.ondev.store/).\n<!-- omgithub:readme:end -->\n## Process lifecycle\n\n- Run long-lived servers and watchers in a persistent session such as tmux.\n- Do not background them in bounded commands without explicit detachment and cleanup.\n- After a timeout, inspect the process and endpoint before retrying or claiming failure.\n\n## Linux browser and WebGPU capture\n\n- Use the preinstalled `playwright-cli` executable from Actions or SSH.\n- Use its headed Chromium, persistent Xvfb display, and SwiftShader configuration.\n- Run `playwright-cli open http://localhost:3002` for the Pascal development server.\n- Load a saved scene. Wait for actual geometry and the active WebGPU renderer.\n- Run `playwright-cli screenshot --filename=screenshots/linux.png` after creating the output directory.\n- Inspect the image. Reject loading screens, empty grids, and blank canvases.\n- Report SwiftShader as CPU software rendering. Do not claim GPU hardware acceleration.\n- Inspect `$HOME/.local/share/omgithub-playwright/linux.json` for launch settings.\n- Use `playwright-cli --help` for commands and named sessions. Pass configuration only to `open`.\n\n## Mobile browser games\n\n- Support Android and iOS phones and tablets with responsive layouts and usable touch controls.\n- Keep gameplay and controls visible within safe areas and avoid browser gesture conflicts.\n- Add tilt controls only when appropriate; offer touch alternatives and request iOS motion permission from a user gesture when needed.\n- Follow explicit device and control requirements in the user request.\n---start.sh\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\n/usr/bin/time -p node \"${RUNTIME_DIR:?}/scripts/default-start.mjs\"\n---capture\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\n/usr/bin/time -p node \"${RUNTIME_DIR:?}/scripts/default-capture.mjs\"\n---startup\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n---git\n?? .gitignore\n?? Agents.md\n?? capture.sh\n?? start.sh\n?? startup.sh\n"}],"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0}},"time":{"created":1793907757178,"ran":1793907757713,"completed":1793907757744}}],"snapshot":{"start":"c2c9e420be818fed4974938cb475c31a0a06c4f3","end":"c2c9e420be818fed4974938cb475c31a0a06c4f3","files":[]},"finish":"tool-calls","rawFinish":"tool_calls","cost":0,"tokens":{"input":4760,"output":85,"reasoning":11,"cache":{"read":1664,"write":0}}},{"id":"msg_1ad3c12c1001JQKOoRWTLv0OoQ","time":{"created":1793907757765,"streamed":1793907760297,"completed":1793907760375},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-free","providerID":"opencode","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Repo empty basically. Need create game from scratch. Need likely base web app no framework. Need understand runtime scripts maybe env. Let's inspect dirs .agents, package files, environment.","native":{"reasoningField":"reasoning_content"},"time":{"created":1793907758764,"completed":1793907760288}},{"type":"tool","id":"call