ious page\n  go-forward                  go forward to the next page\n  reload                      reload the current page\n\nKeyboard:\n  press <key>                 press a key on the keyboard, `a`, `arrowleft`\n  keydown <key>               press a key down on the keyboard\n  keyup <key>                 press a key up on the keyboard\n\nMouse:\n  mousemove <x> <y>           move mouse to a given position\n  mousedown [button]          press mouse down\n  mouseup [button]            press mouse up\n  mousewheel <dx> <dy>        scroll mouse wheel\n\nSave as:\n  screenshot [target]         screenshot of the current page or element\n  pdf                         save page as pdf\n\nTabs:\n  tab-list                    list all tabs\n  tab-new [url]               create a new tab\n  tab-close [index]           close a browser tab\n  tab-select <index>          select a browser tab\n\nStorage:\n  state-load <filename>       loads browser storage (authentication) state from a file\n  state-save [filename]       saves the current storage (authentication) state to a file\n  cookie-list                 list all cookies (optionally filtered by domain/path)\n"}],"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0}},"time":{"created":1793907772943,"ran":1793907773443,"completed":1793907773815}}],"snapshot":{"start":"c2c9e420be818fed4974938cb475c31a0a06c4f3","end":"c2c9e420be818fed4974938cb475c31a0a06c4f3","files":[]},"finish":"tool-calls","rawFinish":"tool_calls","cost":0,"tokens":{"input":3716,"output":142,"reasoning":286,"cache":{"read":28288,"write":0}}},{"id":"msg_1ad3c51880017Pz38o5lkuIyNh","time":{"created":1793907773837,"streamed":1793907826913,"completed":1793907827752},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-free","providerID":"opencode","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"We can vendor Three.js. Need design. Let's think.\n\nTheme \"project zomboid\" is recognizable: isometric survival in Knox County, de